text":"ஆர்","lemma":"ār","gloss":"possessing"}],"gloss":"curly"},{"surface":"உளைத்தலை","parts":[{"text":"உளை","lemma":"uḷai","gloss":"hair/mane"},{"text":"தலை","lemma":"talai","gloss":"head"}],"gloss":"haired head"},{"surface":"பொலிய","parts":[{"text":"பொலி","lemma":"poli","gloss":"to shine/look splendid"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"a","gloss":"infinitive suffix"}],"gloss":"to shine"},{"surface":"சூடி","parts":[{"text":"சூடு","lemma":"cūṭu","gloss":"to wear on head"},{"text":"இ","lemma":"i","gloss":"verbal participle suffix"}],"gloss":"wearing"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"குன்றுதலை","parts":[{"text":"குன்று","lemma":"kuṉṟu","gloss":"hill"},{"text":"தலை","lemma":"talai","gloss":"top/place"}],"gloss":"hilltops"},{"surface":"மணந்த","parts":[{"text":"மணந்த","lemma":"மணந்த","gloss":"joined"}],"gloss":"joined","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கானம்","parts":[{"text":"கானம்","lemma":"kāṉam","gloss":"forest/wilderness"}],"gloss":"forest"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"சென்றனர்","parts":[{"text":"சென்றனர்","lemma":"சென்றனர்","gloss":"he went"}],"gloss":"he went","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கொல்லோ","parts":[{"text":"கொல்","lemma":"kol","gloss":"clitic of doubt"},{"text":"ஓ","lemma":"ō","gloss":"clitic of emphasis/doubt"}],"gloss":"did he really?"},{"surface":"சேயிழை","parts":[{"text":"சேயிழை","lemma":"சேயிழை","gloss":"wearer of choice jewels"}],"gloss":"wearer of choice jewels","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"நமரே","parts":[{"text":"நமர்","lemma":"namar","gloss":"our man/lover"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"clitic of emphasis"}],"gloss":"our lover"}]}],"literal":"White sand abundant green-stemmed thorny / round palmyra's crown white-fronded / desert neem's dense white flowers / curly haired head to shine wearing / hills-top joined forest / did he go? oh, wearer of choice jewels, our man.","translation":"Did our lover really go through the forest where hills meet the sky, wearing dense white neem flowers from the desert, along with the white fronds from the crown of the round palmyra with its green, thorny stem, to make his curly-haired head look splendid?","modern":"வெண்மையான மணலில் செழித்து வளர்ந்த, பசிய காம்பினையும் முட்களையும் உடைய திரண்ட பனைமரத்தின் உச்சியிலுள்ள வெண்மையான ஓலையையும், பாலைநிலத்து வேப்பமரத்தின் அடர்ந்த வெண்மையான பூக்களையும், சுருண்ட மயிர்முடி விளங்குமாறு சூடிக்கொண்டு, குன்றுகள் பொருந்திய காட்டில் நம் தலைவர் சென்றாரோ?","explanation":"The heroine is speaking to her close friend in the Pālai (desert/wilderness) landscape. She is anxious about her lover who has departed on a journey through the harsh desert to earn wealth. She describes the dry, hilly forest path where the hills seem to touch the sky. To protect himself from the heat or as a mark of the journey, she imagines him wearing a wreath made of the white fronds of the palmyra palm and the dense white flowers of the desert neem tree. The contrast of the cool, white flowers and fronds against the scorching desert heat reflects her deep concern for his well-being. The key words are 'கானம் சென்றனர் கொல்லோ' (did he go to the forest?) and 'நமரே' (our lover).","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}